{"articleNo":"1357","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1357&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"미취업 졸업생 인턴 모집 안내_(주)석원","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.08.24","hit":"9543","attachments":[{"name":"붙임 2. 미취업졸업생인턴 주간보고서,결과보고서(학생작성)1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1357&attachNo=69965"},{"name":"붙임 1. 미취업 졸업생 인턴 신청 서류.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1357&attachNo=69968"},{"name":"붙임 3. 미취업 졸업생 인턴 신청 업체_20100902.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1357&attachNo=71435"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">『그린에너지시스템인재양성센터』</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">미취업 졸업생 인턴 모집 안내_(주)석원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">본 센터에서는 졸업생들을 대상으로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 취업능력향상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">을 위하여 미취업 졸업생 인턴십을 실시하고자하오니 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">지원자격</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 본교 참여전공(기계공학부, 전자공학부, 정보나노소재공학전공, 재료공학전공, 금속공학전공, 고분자공학전공, 산업시스템공학전공, 응용화학전공, 환경공학전공) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">미취업 졸업생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">인턴기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 2010년 8월 ~ 2011년 4월 30일(최소 1개월~최대 6개월)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">근무시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 기업체 근무시간 준수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">참여기업, 인턴수당</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 기업체에 따라 상이 (붙임3. 참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">5. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">특이사항</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 4대보험 개인부담금 지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">6. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">참여학생 의무사항</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> (붙임2. 참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 인턴 사전교육 참가(센터에서 진행, 일정 추후공지)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 주간보고서(매주1부), 결과보고서(1부) 작성 및 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">7. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">결과통보 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">: 개별통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">신청기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 채용완료시 까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">신청서류</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">(붙임1.참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 미취업 졸업생 인턴 신청서 1부(기간 미기재)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 이력서, 자기소개서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 졸업증명서, 성적증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 어학성적(해당자한함), 자격증 사본(해당자한함) 등</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">신청방법</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 신청서류를 이메일, 팩스, 우편으로 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">※ 기타 문의사항은 아래의 연락처로 문의바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">주소 : [730-701] 경상북도 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교 공동실험실습관 401호</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">TEL. 054)478-7930 FAX. 054)478-7934 E-mail: </span><a href=\"mailto:tomsy@kumoh.ac.kr\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">tomsy@kumoh.ac.kr</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
